The film stars Hill and Channing Tatum in the lead roles, alongside
Brie Larson, Dave Franco, Rob Riggle, and Ice Cube.

14
01:09:21,818 --> 01:09:27,818
It is an adaptation of  the 1987–1991 television
series of the same name by Stephen J.

